WEBVTT

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:21.120
Got a dance in my mind.

00:00:23.839 --> 00:00:25.760
It's a memory on fast forward

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:29.320
and on rewind it's reoccurring

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:30.239
and rhythmic.

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:35.359
Chaotic and systemic.

00:00:37.799 --> 00:00:40.479
You put a dance in my bones.

00:00:43.719 --> 00:00:50.960
And every chance I'm alone I groove with you.

00:00:53.119 --> 00:00:55.359
For a groove or two.
